The issue is that for `BasisMeasure`, if `len(instruction.targets) == 0`, it never gets expanded to all qubits like regular `Measure` does. So when the validation `len(instruction.targets) != self.nb_qubits` is checked, it will be `0 != self.nb_qubits` which is true (unless nb_qubits is 0), causing the error.

The fix is to ensure that `BasisMeasure` with empty targets also gets expanded to all qubits, just like regular `Measure`.

