        4x4 matrix, we can reconstruct the matrix using the following formula:

        .. math::
            \begin{pmatrix}
                0 & h_{0} & h_{1} & h_{2} \\
                -h_{0} & 0 & h_{3} & h_{4} \\
                -h_{1} & -h_{3} & 0 & h_{5} \\
                -h_{2} & -h_{4} & -h_{5} & 0
            \end{pmatrix}

        where :math:`h_{i}` is the :math:`i`-th element of the Hamiltonian coefficients vector.

        :return: The Hamiltonian coefficients matrix.
